          "Traditional ML (DIY):\nYour Laptop \u2192 AWS EC2 \u2192 Your Kubernetes Cluster \u2192 Disaster\n  \u251c\u2500 Setup Python env\n  \u251c\u2500 Configure storage\n  \u251c\u2500 Manage security\n  \u2514\u2500 Handle scaling\n  \u23f1\ufe0f Setup: Days/weeks\n\nSageMaker (Managed):\nData (S3) \u2192 SageMaker Studio \u2192 Training Job \u2192 Endpoint \u2192 Done\n  \u2022 Infrastructure provided\n  \u2022 Auto-scaling built-in\n  \u2022 Security built-in\n  \u23f1\ufe0f Setup: Minutes"
