        [
          "python",
          "Browser \u2192 SageMaker Studio\n\u251c\u2500 Left sidebar\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500 File Browser (navigate project files)\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500 Git Integration (commit code)\n\u2502  \u251c\u2500 Experiments (browse all runs)\n\u2502  \u2514\u2500 Models (registered models)\n\u251c\u2500 Main area\n\u2502  \u2514\u2500 Notebook (Jupyter-like interface)\n\u2502     \u251c\u2500 Write code\n\u2502     \u251c\u2500 Run cells\n\u2502     \u251c\u2500 Visualize outputs\n\u2502     \u2514\u2500 Create/train models\n\u2514\u2500 Kernel\n   \u2514\u2500 Pre-installed: numpy, pandas, boto3, sagemaker SDK"
